>Mattoo</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ethylene-biosynthesis and perception</article-title><source>Critical Reviews in Plant Sciences</source><year>1996</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>479</fpage><lpage>524</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Giovannoni</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Molecular biology of fruit maturation and ripening</article-title><source>Annual Review of Plant Physiology and Plant Molecular Biology</source><year>2001</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>725</fpage><lpage>749</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib22"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hartmann</surname><given-names>HT</given-names></name><name><surname>Kester</surname><given-names>DE</given-names></name><name><surname>Davies</surname><given-names>FT</given-names></name><name><surname>Geneve</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name></person-group><source>Plant propagation</source><year>2002</year><edition>7th edn</edition><publisher-loc>Upper Saddle River, NJ</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Pearson Education</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Itzhaki</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Woodson</surname><given-names>WR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Characterization of an ethylene-responsive glutathione S-transferase gene cluster in carnation</article-title><source>Plant Molecular Biology</source><year>1993</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>43</fpage><lpage>58</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8499618</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jackson</surname><given-names>DI</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gibber